{"title": "Channel Divinity: Guided Strike", "pageid": 40064, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Channel_Divinity:_Guided_Strike", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guided_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Guided_Strike.webp/300px-Guided_Strike.webp, /w/images/8/81/Guided_Strike.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Guided_Strike.webp/300px-Guided_Strike.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Guided_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Channel Divinity: Guided Strike</b> is a passive feature used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/25px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/38px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/50px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Adrielle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/25px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a>. It allows her to use her <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charges</a> to grant +10 to their next attack roll.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Channel the guidance of your god to strike with supernatural accuracy. You gain a +10 bonus to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a></span> </dd><dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guided Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\">Guided Strike</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715155821\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCompli